<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - Feb 10.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ASX substantial shareholding notices - Feb 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>Carlton &amp; United Breweries Ltd increased its relevant interest in Ballarat Brewing Company Limited on 06/02/1997, from 23,376,117 ordinary shares (86.27%) to 24,194,328 ordinary shares (89.29%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
